    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62342" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέκος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dish, pot, pan</i>, Demioprat. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				10.87
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hippon.
				58
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phoen.
				2.2
			</span></i>:—
				Dim.
			 forms <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεκ-ίς</span></b> ,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, ἡ,
				<i><span class="en">
				Epich.
				126
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>VP</u>
				26.119
			</span></i> (pl.); 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παροψίς</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεκῐθο-ίσκος</span></b> ,
				ὁ, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
			</span></i> l.c.:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεκῐθο-ίσκιον</span></b> , τό, a small
			measure or weight, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i><i>Acut. (Sp.</i>)<i><span class="en">
				63
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				69
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεκάνη</span>.</div>
